    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"necessary evil\" is a pretty intense way to phrase it. if the goal was just to end the war, couldn't they have used conventional warfare or kept the blockade going? it feels like the decision to target entire cities with nuclear weapons was less about saving lives and more about a massive display of force to intimidate other countries like the soviet union.",
